# viewport 1440x900
until 1200 ODDWATER
frames 40
expect ODDWATER
click Feed
expect Dinner is served
expect Done.
click Water change
expect 30% water changed
click Plant
expect A new plant takes root
click Watch
frames 30
expect Move, tap or press any key to return
frames 400
save desktop-tour
click 720 450
frames 120
expect ODDWATER
click ?
expect Welcome to Oddwater
click Back to the water
key F1 2
expect Options
save desktop-options
key Escape 2
save desktop
